# The declared graph vocabulary (spec 393 R2): <name> <capability> <effect class>, one kind per line.
# `xtask lint-graph-kinds` refuses a [[node]] kind not named here. Prose: docs/03-reference/graph-vocabulary.md.
# Capability is what the kind's factory requires, `none` when empty; `call` is inlined at load and holds the host's.
transform  none          pure
route      none          pure
refuse     none          pure
call       host          inlined
timer      none          pure
gate       none          pure
post       post          mutates_external
tool       per_node      mutates_external
judge      proc          mutates_external
coder      spawn,proc    mutates_external
agent      per_node,net  mutates_external
recall     memory_read   reads_fs
remember   memory_write  mutates_external
ledger     ledger        mutates_external
